  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\nThe HugeRTE Blazor component 1.0.0 is based on the HugeRTE Blazor component 2.2.1\n\n## 1.0.0 - 2026-02-14\n\n### Removed\n- Removed `Readonly` property.\n- Removed `CloudChannel` property.\n- Removed `LicenseKey` property.\n\n### Changed\n- The `Disabled` property now toggles the `readonly` mode.\n\n### Added\n- New `CdnVersion` property.",
